  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "…………\r\n……冬優子、笑い方が……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1018003090020,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "何よ、細かいことツッコんでんじゃないっつーの\r\nそれより、いい？　聞きなさい",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/101800309/1018003090020"
  },
  {
    "id": 1018003090030,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "『ふゆちゃん、前から可愛いとは思ってたけど\r\n可愛いだけじゃなくてアイドルに対して真面目なんだな』",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim4": "eye_right",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101800309/1018003090030"
  },
  {
    "id": 1018003090040,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "『俺たちのふゆは大天使\r\n俺たちにもスタッフにも優しい』",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101800309/1018003090040"
  },
  {
    "id": 1018003090050,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "『マジで健気。応援したい』",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101800309/1018003090050"
  },
  {
    "id": 1018003090060,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "『黛のファンになった』",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101800309/1018003090060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それは──\r\nこの間の密着取材の？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1018003090070,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "そ！\r\nまぁちょっと批判もあるけど──概ね好評ね",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charAnim4": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101800309/1018003090070"
  },
  {
    "id": 1018003090080,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "ドキュメンタリーさまさまだわ！\r\nふゆの狙い通りだもの",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101800309/1018003090080"
  },
  {
    "id": 1018003090090,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "まーったくみんなチョロいったら！\r\nあははははっ",
    "charAnim1": "smile3",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101800309/1018003090090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……こら\r\n言い方気を付けろよ……？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1018003090100,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "うっさい\r\n人が機嫌よくしてるんだから余計なこと言わないで",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_jito",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_jito",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101800309/1018003090100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……\r\n──まぁ、そうだな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "冬優子の自己プロデュースの賜物っていえば──",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1018003090110,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "…………はぁ",
    "charAnim1": "wait5",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101800309/1018003090110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "えっ、なんだ？\r\nなんのため息だ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1018003090120,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "あんたに呆れたため息よ\r\nカメラもないのにいい子ちゃんぶっちゃって",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101800309/1018003090120"
  },
  {
    "id": 1018003090130,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "──そんな綺麗に言わなくていい",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101800309/1018003090130"
  },
  {
    "id": 1018003090140,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "これは、ふゆが大勢を騙くらかせたって証明よ\r\nふゆの力の証明よ",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101800309/1018003090140"
  },
  {
    "id": 1018003090150,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "ふゆはちゃーんとやりきれるの\r\n通用するの",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101800309/1018003090150"
  },
  {
    "id": 1018003090160,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "だからあんたはふゆと組んで、\r\nもっと大きな仕事をする義務がある──",
    "charAnim1": "anger3",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101800309/1018003090160"
  },
  {
    "id": 1018003090170,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "言ってること、わかるわね？",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101800309/1018003090170"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……騙すっていうよりは、ファンが見たいものを\r\n的確に見せていく、ってことだと思ってるんだけどな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1018003090180,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "うふふっ\r\nプロデューサーさんは優しいですね♡",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101800309/1018003090180"
  },
  {
    "id": 1018003090190,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "──言ったでしょ、そんな綺麗に言わなくていいの",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101800309/1018003090190"
  },
  {
    "id": 1018003090200,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "ふゆは、ふゆが思う理想の『ふゆ』しか見せない\r\nあんたや──",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101800309/1018003090200"
  },
  {
    "id": 1018003090210,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "……あさひと愛依に見せてる、\r\nこんなふゆは他の誰にも悟らせない",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101800309/1018003090210"
  },
  {
    "id": 1018003090220,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "信じてないのよ、ファンを",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101800309/1018003090220"
  },
  {
    "id": 1018003090230,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "──だぁい好きではありますけどっ♡",
    "charAnim1": "smile4",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101800309/1018003090230"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "冬優子……",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1018003090240,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "だから、『騙してる』が合ってるの",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101800309/1018003090240"
  },
  {
    "id": 1018003090250,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "──ま、そういうことだから？",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101800309/1018003090250"
  },
  {
    "id": 1018003090260,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "あんたはせいぜい、レアなふゆが見られる幸運を\r\n噛みしめておいたらいいんじゃない？",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101800309/1018003090260"
  },
  {
    "id": 1018003090270,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "もちろん、秘密はちゃぁんと守らないと承知しないから",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101800309/1018003090270"
  },
